<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 29.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 29.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Thursday, May 29:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,568.40 (1,567.30)	CHF  1,106.40 (1,107.30)</p>
<p>    DEM    922.59 (923.19)	  GBP  2,562.80 (2,556.90)</p>
<p>    ATS    131.09 (131.17)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Wednesday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $18.63 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$14.23 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $32.86 million ($23.49 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
